props.description:
Layout (m3.material.io / Compose `HorizontalMultiBrowseCarousel`,
`HorizontalUncontainedCarousel`, `HorizontalCenteredHeroCarousel`):
- `multi-browse` — large, medium and small (40–56dp) items, start-snapped;
- `uncontained` — single-size items flowing past the edge, free scrolling;
- `hero` — centered hero: a large item with a small item on each side,
  center-snapped (the first / last item align to the start / end).

@deprecated Ignored — the toggle keeps `ariaLabel` in both states and
exposes open / closed through `aria-expanded` (m3 / APG). Will be removed
in v2.

- `standard` — always visible, inline beside the content;
- `modal` — an overlay with a scrim (`open` / `onClose`);
- `dismissible` — inline like `standard`, but `open` slides it in and out,
  pushing the content beside it; no scrim, the page stays interactive
  (Compose `DismissibleNavigationDrawer`).
